  "body": "[v1 send_join](https://spec.matrix.org/v1.6/server-server-api/#put_matrixfederationv1send_joinroomideventid) has been effectively deprecated since May 2020 (https://github.com/matrix-org/matrix-spec-proposals/pull/2547). \r\n\r\nAny servers still relying on it are likely to have other problems federating (any Synapse versions old enough not to support v2 are likely riddled with security holes).\r\n\r\nIts presence in the spec is a source of confusion (cf https://github.com/matrix-org/matrix-spec/issues/1514, #1515)\r\n\r\nIMHO it's time we got rid of it. This will need an MSC though.",
